{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022155947245-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022162928\"/><p>事主居住沙田隆亨邨。</p><p>今日(22日)早上10時06分，執法部門接獲一名姓張(83歲)老婦的家人報案，指張婦位於沙田隆亨邨慧心樓的住所內，有一批約值19萬港元的金飾不翼而飛，懷疑被人盜去。經初步調查，警員將案件列作「盜竊」，並且鎖定一名已於本月離職的40至50歲印尼裔女傭，懷疑她與案有關，正設法展開追緝。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:41:35.508561+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:59:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:47.898121+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:47.898121+00:00","content_hash":"88bc4b870ee91d85a60b84e16ccd7acebfb332da795a68e0dc689d18ec1ef73a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}